p doing is  having a conversation with stephanie  meyer and this is the final result  but kristin didn't just stop at the  rings she helped one of her fellow  co-stars get her hands on the prop she  had been vying for while filming the  first twilight movie nikki reed  absolutely loved the cleats that rosalie  wore during the twilight baseball scene  but she was just a little too nervous  about taking them and although kristin  kept pushing saying this is not a big  deal you can just have your shoes  nikki just couldn't do it you don't  understand what you're doing kristin  took them for me because i just could  never take anything from the set because  i'm such a rule follower regardless she  didn't just swipe them for her she made  it a huge surprise the two had a thing  going where they would buy each other  converse shoes but one day kristen put  the cleats in the shoebox  instead ashley greene was obsessed with  alice's wardrobe and who can blame her  the cullens all had fashion sense but  alice was on a whole other level ashley  was especially drawn to her undercover  look in italy while filming new moon  ashley has been very open about the  amount of borrowing she's done oh really  while what she wanted was the stunning  michael kors coat she wore she had to  settle for stealing the ray-ban  sunglasses she wore instead she's still  in disbelief that she didn't get to keep  the coat it's just so crazy that i  didn't end up getting it on the bright  side she still has the glasses to  remember the jacket by who wouldn't want  to make a scene  peter faccinelli followed in kristin's  footsteps but wasn't successful at first  when new moon wrapped he knew he had to  find a way to keep the extremely cool  custom cullen ring he got to wear but he  got caught they called me and asked for  it back i was like i don't know where it  is they were like we need it for the  next movie but peter was persistent and  safe to say in the end he was successful  with his prop stealing when we did  breaking dawn part two it might have or  it might not have been left on my finger  when i got home don't worry peter no one  has to know  kellen lutz claims he wasn't all that  into the whole prop stealing situation  and instead kept the memories from the  film close to heart but there was one  prop he walked away with from the first  film just like his on-screen wife he  became quite attached to the vampire  baseball scene and asked the producers  if he could take the hat emmet war okay  so he didn't exactly steal the prop but  he had the guts to ask to take one and  that is just as scary i tried to steal  mackenzie foy but i wasn't allowed while  these cast members will have something  to remember their time on twilight by  others like taylor lautner who turned  down jacob's wig i should have kept that  thing and elizabeth reeser who just  never had the opportunity to take  anything have major regrets i thought  they would call me later and offer me  something and they never did sometimes  stealing that prop is worth the risk  just ask nikki what twilight prop would  you want to take home with you let us  know in the comment section below thanks  for watching  you

